WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.384
Roadmap shows the newest analysis first.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:09.624
Grey is the previous round. Blue shows the updated inspection priorities.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:16.488
Bridge E one twenty-five still ranks first, at about fifty-one people whose access could be restored.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:20.520
Each milestone keeps its actual computation time.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:25.688
In the Bayesian network, click the shaking node for bridge E seventy-three.

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:33.968
The reading narrows the shaking distribution. Its median shifts from point one two one to point zero five one g.
